### How to Use
1. Open **draw.io** (https://app.diagrams.net) or the VS Code draw.io extension
2. Click **File → Open** and select the [.drawio](file:///c:/Users/Angel/Desktop/01-Academic/3rdYear-Capstone/PROJECT%20CARL/%5B05%5D%20REVISED_CHAPTERS_OR_SECTIONS/FISHBONE_DIAGRAM.drawio) file
3. The diagram will load with all nodes, arrows, and colors pre-configured
4. Adjust positions/sizes as needed to fit your document layout
5. Export as **PNG** or **PDF** for your capstone manuscript

> [!TIP]
> When exporting for your manuscript:
> - Use **File → Export as → PNG** with **Zoom: 200%** for sharp printing
> - For landscape diagrams (especially the FDD), use **Orientation: Landscape**
> - Remember to add figure captions per DCT format: `Figure 4-X: [title]`

