## 5. Mapping: Root Causes → Solutions

| Fishbone Cause | Solved By (FDD Module) |
|---------------|----------------------|
| Math anxiety ↔ working memory | **B.** Math Battle System (reframes drills as combat) |
| Chocolate-Covered Broccoli | **B.** Math as core mechanic, not overlay |
| Static difficulty | **C.** Level-Based Difficulty System |
| No adaptive scaling | **E.** Enemy Auto-Scaling |
| Internet-dependent games | **I.** Save System (offline via NW.js) |
| Paid/freemium barriers | Free standalone app (scope decision) |
| No safe practice space | **A.5** Training Hall System |
| No narrative context | **L.** Game Assets & story biomes |
| Single-operation games | **C.** Covers Add → Sub → Mul → Div → PEMDAS |
| No real-time feedback | **F.** Performance-Based Reward (2.0x/1.0x/0.5x/0x) |
| No collaboration tools | **H.** P2P Multiplayer |
| Limited educator control | **C.4** Training Dummy (fixed-level practice) |
